    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The leader of a gang of cats, all pets long abandoned by their masters. They are known for snatching fresh fish from the very nets of the Fishermen, and the Fish Traders' Association has offered a great bounty for them. Many hunters have tried to catch the cats, but ultimately gave up their chase because the cats were too cute. Animals Lv. 4 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Animals. P. Crit. Rate +25 Speed +5 P. Def. -5% Resistance to Bleed -15% Resistance to Speed Down +20% Resistance to Bow -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
